  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.header": "Curing Tobacco",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_1": "Drying Racks preserve the leaf variety and quality while one of four curing environments does the work",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_2": "Air-curing works naturally; Create Encased Fan airflow can accelerate it without changing the cure type",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_3": "Sun-curing uses direct daylight or a glass shelter above the rack and produces Sun-Cured leaves",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_4": "Fire-curing places the rack directly over a lit Campfire, exposing the tobacco to smoke and heat",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_5": "Blowing air through a lit Campfire carries smoke across the rack, accelerating Fire-curing",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_6": "Flue-curing uses a lit Flue Firebox nearby under a roof, providing indirect heat without smoke touching the leaves",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_7": "Blowing air through Lava creates intense smoke-free heat, accelerating Flue-curing",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_curing.text_8": "Mechanical Arms can load raw leaves and only extract them after the selected curing process is complete",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_processing.header": "Cutting and Pressing Tobacco",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_processing.text_1": "A Deployer holding a Chaveta cuts cured leaf through Rough, Ribbon and Shag stages",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_processing.text_2": "The Mechanical Press converts Rough-cut tobacco into Flake while preserving tobacco metadata",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_blending.header": "Blending and Fermenting Tobacco",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_blending.text_1": "A Mechanical Mixer combines two or three compatible loose tobaccos into metadata-aware blends",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_blending.text_2": "Blend components and secret blend identity are carried forward",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_blending.text_3": "Mechanical Arms and Packagers can feed compatible batches into Tobacco Barrels without bypassing batch rules",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_flavoring.header": "Aqua Vitae, Essences and Shisha",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_flavoring.text_1": "With heat, the Mechanical Mixer combines water, sugar and wheat into Aqua Vitae",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_flavoring.text_2": "Aqua Vitae plus a flavor ingredient produces the corresponding Flavoring Essence",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_flavoring.text_3": "A Spout can apply a full 1000 mB Essence to loose tobacco for a light aromatic casing",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_flavoring.text_4": "Flavored Molasses mixed heavily with suitable loose tobacco produces Shisha",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_assembly.header": "Automating Cigarettes and Cigars",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_assembly.text_1": "Deployers assemble tobacco with the required paper or wrapper into metadata-carrying intermediates",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_assembly.text_2": "A Mechanical Press finishes the Cigarette or Cigar without discarding quality, flavor or blend metadata",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_logistics.header": "Tobacco Factory Logistics",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_logistics.text_1": "Stock Links expose Tobacconist inventories and storage to Create's logistics network",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_logistics.text_2": "Packagers can deliver valid inputs directly to Drying Racks, Tobacco Barrels and Flue Fireboxes",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_logistics.text_3": "Mechanical Arms can route inputs and completed products while each Tobacconist machine enforces its own rules",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_logistics.text_4": "Factory Gauges can restock tobacco by quality tier, so different numeric scores in the same tier can satisfy demand",
  "tobacconistmod.ponder.tobacconist_logistics.text_5": "Create packaging preserves Tobacconist components, keeping factory logistics metadata-safe"
}
